\r\nCurrently, some tests like the one in JavassistProxyFactoryTest fails if the RpcContext set by RpcContextTest.testAsync is not removed. Specifically, tests like JavassistProxyFactoryTest.testGetInvoker will see the following failure without the proposed fix (when JavassistProxyFactoryTest.testGetInvoker is run after RpcContextTest.testAsync).\r\n\r\n```\r\nJavassistProxyFactoryTest>AbstractProxyTest.testGetInvoker:68 expected: <java.lang.Object@294425a7> but was: <aa>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe proposed change is to have RpcContextTest.testAsync remove the RpcContext like RpcContextTest.testGetContext when it is done.\r\n\r\n## Brief changelog\r\n\r\ndubbo-rpc/dubbo-rpc-api/src/test/java/org/apache/dubbo/rpc/RpcContextTest.java\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-06-11T21:59:29Z", "updated_at": "2020-07-01T06:39:06Z", "closed_at": "2020-07-01T06:39:06Z", "merged_at": "2020-07-01T06:39:06Z", "merge_commit_sha": "f0c9b3fdd83d03e33ab33effa99c2b34f9a9921c", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "OrDTesters:fix_rpccontexttest", "ref": "fix_rpccontexttest", "repo": {"id": 155263513, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTUyNjM1MTM=", "name": "incubator-dubbo", "full_name": "OrDTesters/incubator-dubbo", "owner": {"login": "OrDTesters", "id": 44483852, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDgzODUy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44483852?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters", "html_url": "https://github.com/OrDTesters", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/OrDTesters/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "http